{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":true,"heading_align":"text-center"}},"1729879484ca8ca6e4":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"ph_breadcrumbs_app_block_YJjtdQ":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/ph-breadcrumbs\/blocks\/app-block\/457dc635-4337-4779-8f31-361dd27778c8","settings":{"show_breadcrumbs":true,"color":"#e95a06","horizontal_alignment":"left","fontsize":16,"breadcrumb_font":"helvetica_n4","marginleft":0,"margintop":0,"marginright":0,"marginbottom":0,"show_home_link":true,"show_last_crumb":true,"home_page":"Home","home_url":"\/","all_uppercase":false,"use_slider":false,"article_use_tag":true,"separator":"<span> › <\/span>","css_tablet":"\/* font-family: Helvetica; *\/","css_mobile":"\/* font-family: Helvetica; *\/","custom_css":"\/* font-family: Helvetica; *\/","css_last_crumb":"\/* font-weight: medium; *\/","css_hover":"\/* text-decoration-line: underline; *\/","menus":"*"}}},"block_order":["ph_breadcrumbs_app_block_YJjtdQ"],"settings":{"full_width":false}},"45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"template--14779356119126__45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"PumpRack’s Diagnostics, Repairs, & Performance Enhancement Services","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"template--14779356119126__45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At PumpRack, we specialize in providing top-notch repair, diagnostic, and performance enhancement services for your pumps. Our mission is to ensure your systems run efficiently and reliably, minimizing downtime and maximizing productivity.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}},"template--14779356119126__45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3-button-1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"ASK US A QUESTION","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/contact","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["template--14779356119126__45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3-heading-1","template--14779356119126__45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3-text-1","template--14779356119126__45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3-button-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Rectangle_8996_1.png","video_external":"","video_description":"","video_autoplay":false,"layout":"right","image_fit":"contain","media_width":50,"media_scale":100,"text_align":"text-start","color_scheme":"none"}},"fdbca7fe-5401-4fee-a519-e9baa6c26c0d":{"type":"pump-rebuild-rich-text","blocks":{"template--14779356119126__fdbca7fe-5401-4fee-a519-e9baa6c26c0d-heading-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Ground-Up Remanufacturing is What We Do","heading_size":"h3","heading_h1":false}},"template--14779356119126__fdbca7fe-5401-4fee-a519-e9baa6c26c0d-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>We don’t believe in charging our customers to see what’s wrong with their pumps, which is why we offer a no-cost evaluation to determine the best course of action. If you end up needing urgent repairs, we are able to accommodate that with our rush services. <\/p><p>You don’t even have to bring your pump to our shop if you don’t want – we can provide you with onsite services (or our fully-equipped shop). Whatever suits your needs the most, we’ve got your back.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["template--14779356119126__fdbca7fe-5401-4fee-a519-e9baa6c26c0d-heading-1","template--14779356119126__fdbca7fe-5401-4fee-a519-e9baa6c26c0d-text-1"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-start","text_align":"text-start","mob_center_text":false,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false,"custom_icon1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/next_2.svg","icon_text1":"Complete RMA\/Talk to Sales Team","custom_icon2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/next_2.svg","icon_text2":"Prepare Your Pump","custom_icon3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/next_2.svg","icon_text3":"Ship to PumpRack","custom_icon4":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/next_2.svg","icon_text4":"Evaluation and No-Obligation Quote"}},"a249f9e5-5a76-4847-80d6-54f3849b8380":{"type":"pumps-rebuild-multi-column","blocks":{"template--14779356119126__a249f9e5-5a76-4847-80d6-54f3849b8380-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_2_3b888b11-adb0-429f-bf95-cfee317d6a6d.svg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Strip Down & Polish Up","text":"<p>Every pump we bring into our shop to re-manufacture is taken apart piece-by-piece. We throw away all soft and minor parts such as gaskets, seals, bearings etc. Then every individual part is thoroughly cleaned and striped down. During this stage we also treat the parts chemically to minimize the risk of rusting and corrosion — part of our “Better than Factory” Quality Program to add value and take the pump past original factory standards.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","custom_icon1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text1":"Tear down every pump to bare parts and metal","custom_icon2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text2":"Throw out gaskets, seals, bearings","custom_icon3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text3":"Clean and chemically treat all non-ferrous metal parts","icon_text4":"Shop By Manufacturer","icon_text5":"Shop By Manufacturer","icon_text6":"Shop By Manufacturer"}},"07b68a3a-0a83-4a7e-a227-5b33f8e5579e":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_4_6d12c7bd-9bd6-49ec-8fb2-93a8318a1de8.svg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Find the Rotten Apples","text":"<p>Once we’ve got the parts loose and cleaned thoroughly, our techs go to work very closely inspecting each and every part. They start with a close visual inspection to find any obvious cracks, cavitation and other signs of wear. We throw out many parts at this point. But the real test begins when we whip out our micrometers! Every pump part we put into a rebuild is closely measured to ensure it generously falls within original factory tolerances.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","custom_icon1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text1":"Visual inspection finds many obvious worn down parts","custom_icon2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text2":"Techs use precision measurement tools to ensure original factory standards","custom_icon3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text3":"Top quality replacement parts used when necessary","icon_text4":"Shop By Manufacturer","icon_text5":"Shop By Manufacturer","icon_text6":"Shop By Manufacturer"}},"279b6c18-abab-43fe-bbe1-30bda27489ff":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_5_36eec1f1-2671-4dd3-bf98-9517918d452f.svg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Special Wear Part Restoration","text":"<p>Extend the life of your pump components with our advanced restoration techniques:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Spray Welding:<\/strong> Rebuild worn parts using durable spray welding technology.<\/li><li><strong>Special Coatings:<\/strong> Apply specialized coatings to enhance the strength and longevity of your components, often exceeding the original material's performance.<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","custom_icon1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text1":"Follow factory documentation","custom_icon2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text2":"Model-specific checklist","custom_icon3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text3":"Port covers, wrapping","custom_icon4":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text4":"Technical training standards","custom_icon5":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text5":"Top quality\/tough paint","custom_icon6":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text6":"As close to factory as possible"}},"1646d2f3-8ece-4b11-a988-6e39b6565329":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_6_-svg.svg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Troubleshooting and Diagnostics","text":"<p>Our comprehensive diagnostic services ensure your pumps are always in top condition:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Phone Support:<\/strong> Get immediate assistance from our knowledgeable support team.<\/li><li><strong>Direct Contact with Our Pump Techs:<\/strong> Speak directly with our experienced technicians for expert advice.<\/li><li><strong>Vibration Analysis:<\/strong> Detect and address issues before they become major problems.<\/li><li><strong>Pressure Testing:<\/strong> Ensure your pump operates at optimal pressure levels for maximum efficiency.<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":"","custom_icon1":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text1":"29-Point evaluation","custom_icon2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text2":"Pressure test PD pumps","custom_icon3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Vector_3_efdd185d-f568-42e4-8de6-c33ba4b4f806.svg","icon_text3":"Dry run? Test operation?","icon_text4":"Shop By Manufacturer","icon_text5":"Shop By Manufacturer","icon_text6":"Shop By Manufacturer"}}},"block_order":["template--14779356119126__a249f9e5-5a76-4847-80d6-54f3849b8380-column-1","07b68a3a-0a83-4a7e-a227-5b33f8e5579e","279b6c18-abab-43fe-bbe1-30bda27489ff","1646d2f3-8ece-4b11-a988-6e39b6565329"],"settings":{"title":"About Our Process","heading_align":"text-center","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","column_size":"large","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-left","image_ratio":"natural","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"btn btn--secondary"}},"a6cff634-6596-4ad9-842e-b96985666686":{"type":"multi-column-slider","blocks":{"template--14779356119126__a6cff634-6596-4ad9-842e-b96985666686-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC_1886-1024x678_1.png","media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"524cb102-dc48-4bb4-8a8a-62c51f33c944":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC_1886-1024x678_2.png","media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"162fbcda-9af9-49d2-8b89-bc78e63a58bd":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC_1886-1024x678_3.png","media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"5172c3c7-7627-4c6e-b346-9ba50738858d":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC_1886-1024x678_4.png","media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"fa1efcc2-0b40-4f87-9ff8-b515fc89f9e9":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Jacketed_Viking_Pumps_1.svg","media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14779356119126__a6cff634-6596-4ad9-842e-b96985666686-column-1","524cb102-dc48-4bb4-8a8a-62c51f33c944","162fbcda-9af9-49d2-8b89-bc78e63a58bd","5172c3c7-7627-4c6e-b346-9ba50738858d","fa1efcc2-0b40-4f87-9ff8-b515fc89f9e9"],"settings":{"title":"Our Techs at Work","heading_align":"text-center","button_label":"","button_link":"","layout":"grid","column_size":"small","column_align":"left","media_align":"text-center","image_ratio":"natural","color_scheme":"none","button_style":"btn btn--secondary"}}},"order":["main","1729879484ca8ca6e4","45f7172f-510e-4244-8804-c6cd06367bb3","fdbca7fe-5401-4fee-a519-e9baa6c26c0d","a249f9e5-5a76-4847-80d6-54f3849b8380","a6cff634-6596-4ad9-842e-b96985666686"]}